</c>

00:26:06.560 --> 00:26:09.280 line:94%
<c.cyan> "A ta santé, Staline", 
 répètent les vignerons, 
</c>

00:26:09.440 --> 00:26:11.320 line:95%
<c.cyan> qui lui offrent le clairon 
</c>

00:26:11.480 --> 00:26:14.120 line:94%
<c.cyan> qui sonna les grèves du Midi 
 en 1907. 
</c>

00:26:14.280 --> 00:26:15.760 line:95%
<c.cyan> -Les artistes communistes 
</c>

00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:18.080 line:94%
<c.cyan> les plus célèbres 
