</c>

00:29:15.320 --> 00:29:17.360 line:95%
<c.magenta> On chante en arabe. 
</c>

00:29:17.520 --> 00:29:19.360 line:95%
<c.yellow> De cette vie laborieuse 
</c>

00:29:19.520 --> 00:29:22.520 line:94%
<c.yellow> il ne reste que ruines, 
